      "section": "Come Shred With Us",
      "heading": "Come Shred With Us",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Husky Winter Sports offers both ski and snowboarding lessons for kids and adults alike!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "white-stripe qa",
      "section": "Logistics",
      "heading": "Logistics",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Scheduling"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Our lessons run for six total weekends during winter quarter. We offer 3-week ("
            },
            {
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "A or B"
            },
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": ") or 6-week lesson packages. Students may choose between our Saturday ("
            },
            {
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "1:30 - 4pm"
            },
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": ") or Sunday ("
            },
            {
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "11:30 - 2pm"
            },
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": ") session."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Group Lessons"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Ages 7+, suitable for all skill levels! Group size is anywhere between 3-5 students per instructor, arranged based on sport type, age, and ability level."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Single-Student Lessons"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Ages 5+. Privates are 1-on-1 student to instructor for a more personalized experience."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Friends and Family Lessons"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Ages 7+. Semi-privates are group lessons where you pick your group of 2-5 kids. Please email "
            },
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": "mailto:huskywslessons@gmail.com",
              "text": "huskywslessons@gmail.com"
            },
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": " if interested in registering students ages 5 and 6 for semi-private lessons."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "purple-stripe",
      "heading": "2026/27 Dates",
      "boxes": [
        {
          "heading": "Session A",
          "items": [
            "Lesson 1: Jan 30 - Jan 31",
            "Lesson 2: Feb 6 - Feb 7",
            "Lesson 3: Feb 20 - Feb 21"
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Session B",
          "items": [
            "Lesson 1: Feb 27 - Feb 28",
            "Lesson 2: Mar 6 - Mar 7",
            "Lesson 3: Mar 13 - Mar 14"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "white-stripe qa",
      "section": "Levels",
      "cards": true,
      "_note": "The four levels are a comparison, not a sequence of prose: cards let a parent scan them side by side and pick one.",
      "heading": "Levels",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "We offer lessons for four levels: Never-ever, Beginner, Intermediate, and Advanced. When registering, please make your best guess as to the most appropriate lesson level and answer every experience question to the best of your ability. The Lesson Director may contact you with more questions while assigning lessons and instructors."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Never-Ever"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "The student is brand new to their snowsport or is returning after a hiatus of a year or more."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Beginner"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "The student can make turns on green terrain and is comfortable riding the Magic Carpet. Lift experience may be limited or nonexistent."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Intermediate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "The student is making linked turns on green terrain and starting to explore blue runs."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Advanced"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "The student can make controlled, linked turns on most runs."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "purple-stripe",
      "heading": "Prices",
      "boxes": [
        {
